    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33448" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλαττον-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>receive less</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ex.</u>
				16.18
			</span></i>; but, <i>give less</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				30.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>waste, be consumed</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>3 Ki.</u>
				17.16
			</span></i>; <i>to be missing, defective,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PMagd.
				26.12
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>lack, want</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				11.22
			</span></i>.</div>
